<title>UK: Bank Audi prices $100 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bank Audi prices $100 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced on Tuesday by lead manager Merrill Lynch has now been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK AUDI</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     9.375 PCT MATURITY    07.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.824    PAY DATE    07.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    99.824    SPREAD	+315 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANNSALE LIMITS US/UK/LB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
